# runit's live state, written into the service directories it is handed.
# p8a symlinks packages/*/services/<name> straight into its supervision tree,
# so runit creates `supervise/` (containing named pipes) and `down` parking
# markers inside the checkout. The practical effect was worse than untidy:
# `git status --porcelain` was never empty there, so `media doctor --fix`
# skipped the phone as "uncommitted changes" every single time — the one host
# that most needs deploying, permanently excluded by its own supervisor.
**/services/*/supervise/
**/services/*/log/supervise/
**/services/*/down

# Local credentials (an API key was left here once — never commit one).
abs.env
*.env
